WEBVTT

00:05.440 --> 00:06.300
Emanate.

00:13.280 --> 00:15.590
Strange beast elimination task completed.

00:15.590 --> 00:19.080
Good job, Atar.
You work quickly.

00:19.080 --> 00:21.460
I'm sure the Emperor will be pleased.

00:22.380 --> 00:25.000
If the Emperor wills it.

01:55.050 --> 02:00.050
Episode 3
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
You who rule over all
the hills of Takaamahara
All our—

01:55.360 --> 01:56.700
We know we are not worthy

01:56.700 --> 01:57.740
O great Lord Mitama

01:57.740 --> 01:59.500
You who rule over all
the hills of Takaamahara

01:59.500 --> 02:00.050
All our—

02:01.800 --> 02:03.010
Open the gate!

02:03.010 --> 02:05.720
The knight Bertrand has returned.

02:06.810 --> 02:08.600
I have important news for the parliament

02:08.600 --> 02:10.700
regarding that dangerous isolation camp.

02:10.700 --> 02:11.310
Hurry up.

02:11.310 --> 02:12.650
Ow!

02:12.650 --> 02:14.890
Wh-What are you doing?

02:14.890 --> 02:17.110
Shut up! Who the hell do you think you are?

02:17.110 --> 02:17.910
I told you, I'm Bert—

02:17.910 --> 02:21.910
You're a cheap tart who shouldn't
even dare speak his name!

02:21.910 --> 02:22.990
Please believe me!

02:22.990 --> 02:25.000
I really and truly am Bertrand!

02:25.000 --> 02:27.010
First off, he is a man.

02:27.010 --> 02:27.870
Believe me!

02:28.390 --> 02:31.460
The people in the isolation camp
forced me into this garb.

02:31.460 --> 02:33.280
So you're from the isolation camp!

02:33.280 --> 02:34.350
Go back! Go back!

02:34.350 --> 02:35.500
W-Wait!

02:35.500 --> 02:37.210
Hear me out...!

02:37.760 --> 02:40.790
I am a knight of this proud empire...

02:40.790 --> 02:42.570
Why did this happen to me?

02:43.580 --> 02:47.770
If the empire abandons me,
what should I even do?

02:49.020 --> 02:50.970
Hey there, Ber-chan.

02:50.970 --> 02:52.860
So you're still around here.

02:52.860 --> 02:55.420
What, are you crying?

02:55.420 --> 02:58.490
Where's all your moxy from this afternoon?

02:56.490 --> 02:58.490
I'll annihilate this village!

02:59.590 --> 03:00.490
Shut up.

03:00.490 --> 03:02.750
Now that I get a closer look,

03:02.750 --> 03:05.830
you've got quite a nice body.

03:05.830 --> 03:07.110
You bastard!

03:07.110 --> 03:09.380
Are you trying to disgrace me?!

03:11.190 --> 03:13.670
<i>I cannot draw my sword unless
it's for the Emperor's justice.</i>

03:19.990 --> 03:20.930
You're...

03:21.720 --> 03:23.140
Are you okay?

03:24.180 --> 03:26.200
B-Because of you, I'm—

03:27.000 --> 03:29.120
Unable to return to
the imperial capital, right?

03:29.640 --> 03:32.080
Without an order from your liege,

03:32.080 --> 03:33.650
you never draw your sword.

03:34.900 --> 03:37.080
Your loyalty is admirable.

03:37.610 --> 03:40.320
Regardless, the empire has discarded you.

03:40.320 --> 03:42.490
That's not true! I...

03:42.490 --> 03:44.060
Admit it.

03:44.780 --> 03:46.780
The empire threw you away.

03:52.230 --> 03:53.650
Come with me.

03:55.250 --> 03:57.340
I need your help.

03:58.260 --> 04:01.670
I'll create a place for you to stay.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.040
Knight Bertrand.

04:06.940 --> 04:09.420
I'd never be taken in by those words.

04:10.050 --> 04:14.790
But you did save me from this cretin,
so I'll repay that favor.

04:15.660 --> 04:17.150
<i>Too easy.</i>

04:19.150 --> 04:20.860
A strange beast!

04:22.030 --> 04:22.920
Damn it!

04:22.920 --> 04:23.820
Not the fields again!

04:23.820 --> 04:24.760
Just run!

04:23.820 --> 04:24.760
Run away!

04:24.760 --> 04:26.130
Run! To the shelter!

04:26.130 --> 04:27.640
Don't do it, Ricky!

04:28.080 --> 04:29.620
You don't stand a chance!

04:29.620 --> 04:30.330
Man, run away!

04:30.330 --> 04:31.950
Let us take care of this.

04:31.950 --> 04:34.710
Let me bring out the ultimate weapon!

04:39.010 --> 04:41.130
The godly blade, Kusanagi no Tsurugi!

04:41.130 --> 04:43.610
This is the real thing, 
summoned from the Kanmon Straits!

04:43.610 --> 04:45.930
Now, use this to defeat it!

04:51.560 --> 04:53.140
Ricky!

04:53.140 --> 04:53.880
Why?!

04:53.880 --> 04:54.380
Idiot!

04:54.380 --> 04:56.540
That useless piece of crap sword 
was submerged in the ocean!

04:56.540 --> 04:58.420
What?! But according to the
legends, it's super strong!

04:58.420 --> 04:59.600
Yeah, according to legends!

04:59.600 --> 05:01.690
I knew counting on you was a bad idea!

05:09.050 --> 05:11.090
It's my fourth underling!

05:11.680 --> 05:12.770
Stand back.

05:18.940 --> 05:19.880
Emanate.

05:34.060 --> 05:34.890
It's over.

05:37.220 --> 05:38.430
Was that what you wanted?

05:39.650 --> 05:40.660
You saved us!

05:40.660 --> 05:41.730
In one hit!

05:40.660 --> 05:41.730
Wow!

05:41.730 --> 05:42.650
I can't believe it!

05:42.210 --> 05:43.480
What a relief.

05:44.120 --> 05:45.770
<i>What the hell was that?</i>

05:45.770 --> 05:47.490
<i>I saw something on the sword...</i>

05:47.990 --> 05:50.630
Oh! Yeah, just as expected!

05:50.630 --> 05:53.520
That's our religion's holy knight!

05:54.680 --> 05:56.710
Good job, underling!

05:56.710 --> 06:00.150
<i>Nice. I've acquired a decent pawn.</i>

06:00.150 --> 06:01.090
Listen to me!

06:01.090 --> 06:03.440
Join our religion and I promise you,
from this day forth,

06:03.440 --> 06:08.290
our holy knight will protect all
of your fields from the strange beasts!

06:08.290 --> 06:09.150
Religion?

06:09.150 --> 06:10.090
What is that?

06:10.090 --> 06:13.750
A religion is where you worship me as god...

06:14.410 --> 06:17.920
Well, just think of it
as a group with loose ties.

06:17.920 --> 06:21.140
We've got this mascot whom we call "god."

06:21.140 --> 06:23.060
What is a mascot?

06:24.210 --> 06:26.600
You know that little animal
they keep at the eatery, right?

06:26.600 --> 06:28.390
Oh, yeah, that little thing?

06:28.390 --> 06:29.300
That's it.

06:30.500 --> 06:34.680
If you become a member of our religion
that loves Mitama as our mascot,

06:34.680 --> 06:38.060
you will never have to fear
 strange beasts ever again!

06:38.060 --> 06:39.180
Wow! I'm in!

06:39.180 --> 06:40.400
Me, too!

06:40.400 --> 06:41.720
Yes!

06:41.720 --> 06:42.840
Now we're talking.

06:44.800 --> 06:46.130
Wine, please!

06:46.740 --> 06:48.680
Have you joined our religion?

06:48.680 --> 06:49.630
The what?

06:49.630 --> 06:51.580
Our religion! Starting today,

06:51.580 --> 06:54.380
wine will only be available
to members of our religion!

06:54.380 --> 06:56.470
Please join if you'd like to drink.

06:56.470 --> 06:59.140
Well, how can I say no 
when you ask so nicely?

06:59.480 --> 07:01.030
Thank you so much!

07:01.030 --> 07:03.450
Then, please write your name
and contact information here.

07:01.330 --> 07:02.220
I'll join, too!

07:02.220 --> 07:03.440
Me, too!

07:03.440 --> 07:06.530
<i>I'll gather followers any way I can.</i>

07:03.850 --> 07:05.580
Yes! Just a moment!

07:07.160 --> 07:09.650
This is a refrigerator called a zeer pot.

07:10.000 --> 07:13.560
It's possible to preserve food
by placing it inside this pot.

07:13.560 --> 07:15.200
If you join our religion right now,

07:15.200 --> 07:16.910
every one of you will get your own pot!

07:18.500 --> 07:21.290
I haven't slept for three days now.

07:21.290 --> 07:25.170
You need to make twenty
additional zeer pots by tomorrow.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.760
You'll work until you drop dead, trash.

07:28.130 --> 07:30.940
Thank you so much, Mitama-sama!

07:30.940 --> 07:33.160
I'll do it!

07:33.160 --> 07:34.150
These are delicious.

07:34.150 --> 07:35.010
What are they?

07:35.010 --> 07:36.790
These are baked sweets called cookies.

07:36.790 --> 07:38.150
Can I have some, too, please?

07:38.150 --> 07:39.250
These are delicious!

07:39.250 --> 07:41.820
If you could just write
your name down here...

07:41.820 --> 07:43.100
Me, too!

07:43.100 --> 07:45.490
Even in your current state,
this should be doable.

07:45.490 --> 07:47.720
Yes, right there!

07:47.720 --> 07:49.150
Please form a line!

07:49.150 --> 07:51.620
I can't believe he's using my
divine powers like a hot spring...

07:51.620 --> 07:55.060
This is a welcome bonus
for those who've become followers!

07:54.160 --> 07:56.160
<b>Followers</b>

07:55.060 --> 07:56.830
This is amazing, Yukito.

07:56.830 --> 07:58.870
Our followers keep growing and growing.

07:59.470 --> 08:00.810
Awesome!

08:00.810 --> 08:04.710
Yes, it was a good idea to
stop relying on your charisma.

08:04.710 --> 08:05.560
Rude!

08:05.560 --> 08:10.150
In this world, concepts like "god" 
and "religion" don't actually exist.

08:10.150 --> 08:12.660
Making them understand those
would be difficult.

08:12.660 --> 08:13.520
But!

08:13.520 --> 08:15.180
If you look at it from another angle,

08:15.180 --> 08:18.340
it means "converting" them is easy
because they have no aversion to religion,

08:18.340 --> 08:21.010
unlike people from my time.

08:21.010 --> 08:24.040
Therefore, we just need to make it
a different form of religion.

08:24.040 --> 08:25.310
A different form?

08:26.180 --> 08:30.190
The followers are not bound together
by devotion, but by personal gain.

08:30.670 --> 08:33.630
Believe and we will heal you,

08:34.830 --> 08:37.640
we'll share food with you,

08:38.890 --> 08:40.330
and protect you from external enemies.

08:41.090 --> 08:43.960
It's a standard move to
amass more followers...

08:45.970 --> 08:49.260
by supplying personal gains
that are easy to understand!

08:49.260 --> 08:50.910
Our religion has...

08:53.130 --> 08:54.920
Bertrand's power,

08:54.920 --> 08:57.830
as well as Al's and Sil's food.

08:57.830 --> 09:00.830
By offering these as benefits,

09:00.830 --> 09:03.390
the followers will start lining up.

09:03.390 --> 09:04.770
Stop it!

09:05.370 --> 09:10.750
My strategy is the same as the one religions
in my old world use to attract believers.

09:10.750 --> 09:14.770
All I did was apply my own knowledge
to make it fit this world.

09:14.770 --> 09:17.930
Looks like watching all that
alternate world stuff came in handy.

09:17.930 --> 09:20.090
I didn't watch anything like that.

09:20.090 --> 09:22.040
I never tried to escape from reality.

09:22.040 --> 09:23.160
All right!

09:23.160 --> 09:25.070
My powers have gotten stronger too.

09:25.070 --> 09:27.540
Even if their army comes,
I'll smash them to bits!

09:29.100 --> 09:31.250
So far, so good.

09:31.250 --> 09:36.390
But who knows how many followers we'll
really need to be able to fight the empire?

09:38.410 --> 09:39.480
Bertrand?

10:05.360 --> 10:06.360
Kill me.

10:09.620 --> 10:12.710
Bertrand, there's something I wanted to ask.

10:13.400 --> 10:14.510
Do you mind?

10:16.200 --> 10:18.300
You want to know how many
soldiers the imperial army has?

10:18.300 --> 10:20.210
What's the point of even asking?

10:20.210 --> 10:22.940
You're planning on moving
against the Emperor?!

10:24.420 --> 10:26.000
Oh, I have no intention of doing that.

10:26.420 --> 10:28.930
I just want to protect this village.

10:29.670 --> 10:30.730
Please.

10:31.750 --> 10:33.030
Well, if that's the case...

10:33.030 --> 10:35.440
You've really got the wrong idea.

10:36.270 --> 10:40.240
It's not numbers that make
the imperial army the imperial army.

10:42.050 --> 10:43.360
Archons?

10:45.260 --> 10:46.510
Yeah.

10:46.510 --> 10:49.520
A small elite unit under
the direct control of the Emperor.

10:49.520 --> 10:51.420
Are they stronger than you?

10:56.340 --> 10:58.910
I'm nothing compared to them.

10:58.910 --> 11:02.130
They've been bestowed special
powers directly from the Emperor.

11:02.130 --> 11:03.220
Powers?

11:03.220 --> 11:05.520
I've only heard rumors myself.

11:06.410 --> 11:08.110
Supposedly,

11:08.560 --> 11:11.880
every single one of them is
strong enough to erase a mountain.

11:12.940 --> 11:14.370
Extermination complete.

11:14.370 --> 11:18.820
Moving on to dealing with the isolation
village that defied the end of life system.

11:23.160 --> 11:24.400
Mitama!

11:24.400 --> 11:27.150
Can you erase a mountain?

11:27.150 --> 11:28.210
A mountain?

11:28.210 --> 11:31.280
A mountain of lame snacks, yeah.

11:31.280 --> 11:33.290
I only go for the good stuff.

11:33.990 --> 11:37.260
This is not the time to make crap jokes.

11:37.260 --> 11:39.270
I want a serious answer.

11:39.270 --> 11:42.760
Japan has a lot of mountain gods.

11:42.760 --> 11:46.320
But my abilities easily
surpass theirs by a lot!

11:46.320 --> 11:48.090
So you can do it?

11:48.090 --> 11:49.170
Easy peasy.

11:49.170 --> 11:51.490
I just need a measly 10,000 followers.

11:52.930 --> 11:56.800
<i>Right now, we have around 
one hundred followers.</i>

11:56.800 --> 11:59.100
I bet you're impressed now, huh, Yukito?!

12:01.450 --> 12:04.280
<i>It's no good. She's useless.</i>

12:10.740 --> 12:12.410
Kabedon.

12:12.870 --> 12:15.540
You've really come into your womanhood.

12:15.540 --> 12:17.340
Wh-What do you mean?

12:17.730 --> 12:19.730
Don't struggle.

12:20.920 --> 12:23.630
D-D-Do you mean to defile me?!

12:23.630 --> 12:26.360
I said I'm just taking a look.

12:27.670 --> 12:29.470
So because I surrendered,

12:29.470 --> 12:32.550
you can do whatever you want to my body?

12:32.550 --> 12:33.750
Kill me!

12:34.060 --> 12:36.360
Down, down, down.

12:36.930 --> 12:38.920
Down, down, down.

12:43.020 --> 12:45.440
There's nothing unusual about it.
This is an ordinary sword.

12:45.440 --> 12:46.520
Give it back!

12:47.070 --> 12:49.040
What about the sword?

12:49.040 --> 12:52.090
You defeated that strange
beast that attacked the village.

12:52.090 --> 12:55.310
That sword shouldn't be able to cut
through something so big, though.

12:55.310 --> 12:57.380
So is there some kind of trick?

12:59.290 --> 13:00.300
Emanate.

13:15.790 --> 13:16.980
Seriously?

13:16.980 --> 13:18.600
There's no trick.

13:18.600 --> 13:20.820
You just don't know how to use it.

13:20.820 --> 13:22.400
There is nothing this sword
could not cut through.

13:22.400 --> 13:25.800
Sword? More like magic!

13:25.800 --> 13:26.910
Magic?

13:26.910 --> 13:29.590
Where do they sell those swords?

13:29.590 --> 13:31.130
<i>If we had a lot of these,</i>

13:31.130 --> 13:33.200
<i>we could stand up against the imperial army!</i>

13:33.200 --> 13:35.410
These can't be bought, of course.

13:36.010 --> 13:40.140
Anyone above a certain rank in the imperial
army is granted a weapon by the Emperor,

13:40.140 --> 13:41.940
imbued with special power.

13:42.820 --> 13:46.930
Nobody but the Emperor understands
the nature of this power, though.

13:50.800 --> 13:54.640
m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 80 l 0 80

13:50.800 --> 13:54.640
<b>Has Knowledge of Modern Times, Unemployed
Urabe Yukito</b>

13:51.230 --> 13:54.650
We will now begin our religion's
administrative committee meeting.

13:54.640 --> 13:56.230
m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 80 l 0 80

13:54.640 --> 13:56.230
<b>Cool Type Farmer
Clen</b>

13:56.230 --> 13:59.860
m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 80 l 0 80

13:56.230 --> 13:59.860
<b>Somewhat Normal Person, Eatery Owner
Siluril</b>

13:56.870 --> 13:59.860
So, why is it only us three?

13:59.860 --> 14:01.440
m 0 0 l 250 0 l 250 80 l 0 80

13:59.860 --> 14:01.440
<b>Idol of the Eatery, Strange Beast
Chilchil</b>

14:01.970 --> 14:06.340
Because you seem like the most
intelligent people in our religion.

14:06.340 --> 14:07.600
Sounds about right.

14:07.600 --> 14:09.160
It really does.

14:09.160 --> 14:10.470
Right now, our religion—

14:10.470 --> 14:14.120
or rather, this village,
is facing a grave danger.

14:14.120 --> 14:17.710
The imperial army could strike at any moment.

14:17.710 --> 14:19.950
But they're not coming at all.

14:19.950 --> 14:22.150
They're probably just observing us for now.

14:22.150 --> 14:25.230
But it is certain that their attack will come.

14:26.160 --> 14:29.370
So, before that happens, hypothetically,

14:29.370 --> 14:32.010
do you think we could
relocate this entire village?

14:32.350 --> 14:33.820
I doubt it.

14:33.820 --> 14:36.380
If we made such a blatant move,

14:36.380 --> 14:38.020
they'd crush us in an instant.

14:38.020 --> 14:39.740
Yeah, huh...

14:39.740 --> 14:42.770
If only we had over 10,000 followers...

14:42.770 --> 14:44.360
Then we could fight back!

14:44.760 --> 14:46.190
That's impossible.

14:46.190 --> 14:49.020
There's about 2,000 people
living in this village.

14:49.020 --> 14:53.660
The empire places a limit on how many
people can live in an isolation camp village.

14:54.820 --> 14:55.810
Wait, wait.

14:55.810 --> 14:58.460
You mean there are more isolation
camp villages other than this one?

14:58.460 --> 14:59.370
Yeah.

15:00.400 --> 15:03.720
There are many isolation camp villages
encircling the imperial capital.

15:03.720 --> 15:05.360
Just like our village,

15:05.360 --> 15:07.880
every one of them is a trash can
for people they deem to be abnormal.

15:11.250 --> 15:14.270
Well, essentially a human wall
to protect the capital!

15:14.270 --> 15:16.140
Don't drink in a meeting!

15:16.140 --> 15:18.360
Can't stop me!

15:18.360 --> 15:18.810
Huh?

15:18.810 --> 15:21.060
I smell booze!

15:21.060 --> 15:22.620
Wait!

15:22.620 --> 15:24.210
Our meeting isn't done yet!

15:23.540 --> 15:25.420
Gimme!

15:25.920 --> 15:27.690
Wait, wait, wait!

15:27.690 --> 15:30.360
This is not the time for booze!

15:32.140 --> 15:34.450
You can take care of the rest, Yukito.

15:42.710 --> 15:45.020
Que sera, sera!

15:45.020 --> 15:46.980
We've got plenty to drink!

15:46.980 --> 15:49.370
Keep it coming!

15:50.950 --> 15:53.050
How long will these pointless
assignments continue?

15:53.540 --> 15:56.650
Annihilating that isolation camp
village is the will of our Emperor

15:56.650 --> 15:58.100
and the decision of the parliament.

16:00.330 --> 16:04.740
Well, these huge strange
beasts keep appearing.

16:04.740 --> 16:07.240
Since they could cause harm to the capital,

16:07.240 --> 16:08.540
we can't just ignore them.

16:08.540 --> 16:11.530
Loki, are you trying to buy more time?

16:11.530 --> 16:13.530
Are you planning on defying
our Emperor and the parliament?

16:13.530 --> 16:16.200
Why would you even say that?

16:16.200 --> 16:19.920
Atar, I am a loyal servant of our Emperor.

16:21.370 --> 16:26.870
Oh, I just got another report
of a strange beast sighting.

16:27.780 --> 16:30.160
Could you please go there?

16:30.160 --> 16:31.410
Roger.

16:31.410 --> 16:32.700
Well then.

16:32.700 --> 16:34.180
I wonder what they'll do?

16:37.570 --> 16:41.800
<i>Over 10,000 followers? That's tough.</i>

16:41.800 --> 16:44.260
You're still awake?

16:44.260 --> 16:45.230
Yeah.

16:45.790 --> 16:47.500
You're completely wasted.

16:47.500 --> 16:50.690
Why don't you tell your big sister
what's on your mind?

16:50.690 --> 16:52.290
My big what now?

16:52.290 --> 16:54.980
I mean you're family,

16:54.980 --> 16:57.140
so you're like my little brother.

16:57.140 --> 16:59.070
So, Sil...

17:00.830 --> 17:05.000
How much about this village's
situation do you really understand?

17:05.000 --> 17:09.180
Well, I know that it's pretty bad.

17:09.820 --> 17:14.760
That's why you've been doing 
all that religion stuff, right?

17:15.620 --> 17:17.260
I don't really get it,

17:17.260 --> 17:20.570
but I guess it's to protect
our village from the capital.

17:21.310 --> 17:22.930
Did I get it?

17:22.930 --> 17:27.020
I thought Mitama and I would be
able to do something, but...

17:27.700 --> 17:29.180
It seems hopeless.

17:28.420 --> 17:29.700
Yukito,

17:29.700 --> 17:33.610
not that little girl Amaterasu, but my...

17:34.030 --> 17:36.530
You're trying your best.

17:36.530 --> 17:38.000
Thank you for that.

17:38.000 --> 17:42.330
Al and I would have died back then.

17:42.330 --> 17:46.010
But you and Mitama-chan saved us.

17:46.770 --> 17:48.800
Even if you can't save this village,

17:48.800 --> 17:51.420
you've already done more than enough.

17:51.970 --> 17:55.040
So you don't have to overthink it.

17:56.700 --> 17:59.180
Don't overthink it, Yukito.

18:02.340 --> 18:06.050
In the beginning, our sect had
around one hundred followers.

18:06.050 --> 18:09.060
Now we have tens of thousands of followers.

18:09.060 --> 18:10.970
Do you know how we did this?

18:10.970 --> 18:12.440
No clue.

18:12.900 --> 18:17.700
Almost all our followers are
pro-level martial artists.

18:17.700 --> 18:23.450
So we blew up a scam cult
with our physical strength

18:23.450 --> 18:26.520
and took over their territory
and followers wholesale.

18:27.160 --> 18:30.750
You should just be a fight club
instead of a religious group.

18:30.750 --> 18:32.930
Don't overthink it.

18:32.930 --> 18:34.450
If you want to get more followers,

18:34.450 --> 18:36.430
just take them over
along with the territory!

18:35.510 --> 18:38.930
<b>Miracles happen through use of force!</b>

18:35.510 --> 18:38.930
Soichiro

18:36.430 --> 18:38.440
Miracles happen through use of force!

18:40.200 --> 18:41.630
With the territory...

18:41.630 --> 18:42.600
What?

18:42.600 --> 18:43.640
Nothing.

18:44.410 --> 18:46.350
I just remembered something dumb.

18:46.710 --> 18:48.170
Thanks, Sil.

18:51.730 --> 18:52.940
Yukito.

18:54.810 --> 18:56.370
Hi, Clen.

18:56.370 --> 18:59.900
Did you come up with a plan 
to deal with the imperial army?

18:59.900 --> 19:01.810
I wouldn't say I have no plan at all.

19:01.810 --> 19:02.850
But...

19:02.850 --> 19:03.900
But?

19:03.900 --> 19:08.680
What I'm trying to do will
destroy the culture of this world.

19:09.670 --> 19:11.470
That sounds fun.

19:11.470 --> 19:12.680
Huh?

19:12.680 --> 19:15.900
What's good about this village
is that compared to the capital,

19:15.900 --> 19:18.170
people here can live freely.

19:19.040 --> 19:22.520
If there is something that you
want to do of your own volition,

19:24.890 --> 19:27.220
then you should feel free to do it.

19:33.930 --> 19:35.650
Okay, then I'll try it.

19:36.360 --> 19:39.030
I'm going to take this village 
500 years into the future!

19:39.480 --> 19:41.390
Huh? What do you mean?

19:44.030 --> 19:46.120
One Month Later

19:54.700 --> 19:56.550
Nothing today, either.

19:56.550 --> 19:58.920
Why is the capital leaving this
isolation camp village alone?

19:58.920 --> 20:00.010
We're not.

20:01.550 --> 20:04.470
Bertrand, we're counting on you
to protect this village.

20:04.470 --> 20:05.660
It's a new outfit!

20:05.660 --> 20:08.720
If you fight wearing this,
I bet you'll look really cute!

20:08.720 --> 20:11.020
I'm sure you'll look amazing in it!

20:18.280 --> 20:21.720
You're not... from the village.

20:23.030 --> 20:24.490
How long have you been there?

20:25.350 --> 20:27.450
<i>I didn't sense her here.</i>

20:29.130 --> 20:31.620
Query initiating.

20:34.720 --> 20:36.470
Affiliation confirmed.

20:36.470 --> 20:39.250
Former captain of 6th regiment
of the imperial knights.

20:39.250 --> 20:42.360
Enlilter Liesheid Bertrand.

20:42.360 --> 20:44.980
Your sex has been changed.

20:44.980 --> 20:47.230
You know who I am?

20:47.230 --> 20:50.980
How did an imperial knight turn into a woman
and end up in the isolation camp village?

20:53.670 --> 20:55.100
Currently,

20:55.540 --> 20:57.930
I'm this religion's underling.

20:57.930 --> 20:59.880
No, I am their bitch!

20:59.880 --> 21:02.110
What is that ridiculous outfit?

21:02.110 --> 21:03.940
You can say all the terrible 
things you want to me!

21:03.940 --> 21:06.570
Actually, I beg you to do so!

21:06.570 --> 21:09.170
I don't understand what you're saying.

21:09.170 --> 21:11.070
I classify you as a rebel.

21:11.070 --> 21:12.080
Emanate.

21:14.510 --> 21:17.670
So you're an archon from the imperial capital.

21:19.400 --> 21:22.500
I didn't expect that I'd draw my
blade against the imperial capital.

21:22.870 --> 21:25.760
Perhaps this is also fate.

21:35.260 --> 21:36.300
Kill me.

21:38.100 --> 21:39.440
I won't kill you.

21:39.440 --> 21:43.560
I must find out why your sex changed.

21:43.560 --> 21:45.280
I'm taking you back to the capital.

21:47.410 --> 21:49.160
What... is that?

21:49.610 --> 21:52.240
I've never seen strange beasts like those.

21:52.240 --> 21:54.250
And humans are riding them?

21:55.610 --> 21:58.200
What kind of isolation camp is that?

